Use payments from "payments-mcp.capability.json"

To RecoverFailures, given a day which is a string, returning an integer
    the failures are ask payments to list_failed with the day
    the retried is 0
    for each payment in the failures
        if the retryCount of the payment is less than 3
            the result is ask payments to retry with paymentId set to the id of the payment
            if the succeeded of the result
                the retried is the retried plus 1
    return the retried
